WEBVTT

00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:35.076
But it would give us carbon-negative,
transit-rich, joyous places

00:08:35.116 --> 00:08:37.556
for people to live
and raise their families.

00:08:38.196 --> 00:08:40.316
Now, you may be thinking,

00:08:40.316 --> 00:08:42.316
"So this is his big idea?

00:08:42.356 --> 00:08:43.836
Small-scale housing,

00:08:43.836 --> 00:08:46.476
solar panels above, light-rail below,

00:08:46.476 --> 00:08:48.196
known technologies throughout,

00:08:48.236 --> 00:08:51.196
all organized into these affordable
green neighborhoods?"

00:08:52.436 --> 00:08:55.756
Even if you believed me
that this was carbon-negative,

00:08:55.756 --> 00:09:00.196
how many of our 11 billion people
could this possibly house?